@startuml
title 7.8 Best Voucher - sequence diagram
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 240
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ParticipantBorderColor #444444
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

actor Customer as U
participant "View" as V <<View>> #EADCFF
participant OrderController as C <<Controller>> #D8F3DC
participant OrderService as S <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant CouponService as CS <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant CouponRepository as CR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9

== A. Every preview carries a suggestion ==
U -> V : open checkout or change items, address or voucher
V -> C : POST /api/orders/{userId}/voucher-preview (as in 7.5)
C -> S : previewVouchers(userId, request, merchandiseOnly)
S -> CS : preview(context, couponCode, shippingCouponCode)
CS -> CR : available(shopId)
CR --> CS : List<Coupon>
CS -> CS : evaluate: eligible money vouchers sorted by saving,\nbestMoney = highest saving, lowest = lowest saving
alt an eligible shipping voucher exists
  CS -> CS : combined = best shipping saving + lowest money saving
  alt combined > saving of bestMoney
    CS -> CS : recommend shipping voucher + lowest money voucher, bestSaving = combined
  else
    CS -> CS : recommend bestMoney only
  end
else no eligible shipping voucher
  CS -> CS : recommend bestMoney only (bestSaving = 0 when none)
end
CS --> S : Preview (recommendedOrderCode, recommendedShippingCode, bestSaving)
S --> C : Preview
C --> V : 200 OK
alt bestSaving > 0
  V --> U : "Gợi ý tiết kiệm nhất: CODE1 + CODE2 — giảm X"\nwith button "Dùng ưu đãi tốt nhất"
else
  V --> U : no suggestion box
end

== B. The customer takes the suggestion ==
U -> V : click "Dùng ưu đãi tốt nhất"
V -> V : couponCode = recommendedOrderCode (or empty),\nshippingCouponCode = recommendedShippingCode (or empty)
V -> C : POST /api/orders/{userId}/voucher-preview (the two recommended codes)
C -> S : previewVouchers(userId, request, merchandiseOnly)
S -> CS : preview(context, recommendedOrderCode, recommendedShippingCode)
CS -> CR : available(shopId)
CR --> CS : List<Coupon>
CS -> CS : evaluate and check both codes (same rules as a manual choice)
CS --> S : Preview (discount and totalAmount for the chosen codes)
S --> C : Preview
C --> V : 200 OK
V --> U : the two codes are ticked, discount lines and total updated

note over CS
  Read-only: no usedCount change, no order created.
  Usage is counted only when the order is placed (7.6 apply()).
end note

@enduml
